WEBVTT

00:08:58.158 --> 00:09:00.744
It's no longer enough
to just put your head down.

00:09:02.454 --> 00:09:03.706
Get the job.

00:09:04.707 --> 00:09:06.083
Accomplish the feat.

00:09:07.209 --> 00:09:09.253
We have to unite, to come together,

00:09:09.295 --> 00:09:12.047
to figure out why barriers
are there in the first place.

00:09:13.257 --> 00:09:14.800
And Generation Z is doing that.

00:09:14.842 --> 00:09:16.093
They're listening.

00:09:16.552 --> 00:09:18.470
They're seeing both sides.

00:09:19.972 --> 00:09:23.475
And they're uniting for causes
that don't directly impact them.

00:09:25.269 --> 00:09:27.521
We have entire sports leagues

00:09:27.521 --> 00:09:29.815
that are standing up
for what they believe in.